  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IR 2.10 POLICY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IR 2.10 By the end of 2014, the national education policies reviewed and strategies developed to mainstream Early Child Development (ECD),  promote school
registration, accreditation and certification for IDP children and returnees, draft peace education curriculum, and strengthen EMIS
for the evidence-based planning and responses.</narrative>
  </description>
